The 9 in an initial 19 and the 0 in an initial 20 are strongly positive.
Date-like prose strengthens this response; mathematical surroundings and nearby
numbers weaken it. Smaller responses mark 11, 21, 30 and 31. Inside longer
numbers the same pairs are weaker or negative. At a document's opening there
is a broad, token-shape-dependent response, only approximated here.
